    "summaryAr": "German Speaking Netflix Customer Experts About Mercier Consultancy Group Mercier Consultancy Group is a premier international staffing firm, recognized for bridging top-tier talent with industry-leading global brands. We specialize in navigating the complexities of the customer support services sector to provide unparalleled career opportunities across Europe. Job Overview We are currently seeking talented profession",
    "descriptionAr": "German Speaking Netflix Customer Experts About Mercier Consultancy Group Mercier Consultancy Group is a premier international staffing firm, recognized for bridging top-tier talent with industry-leading global brands. We specialize in navigating the complexities of the customer support services sector to provide unparalleled career opportunities across Europe. Job Overview We are currently seeking talented professionals to join our team for the German Speaking Netflix Customer Experts position in Greece. This is a unique opportunity to provide world-class support for a global entertainment leader while enjoying the vibrant lifestyle that comes with our exclusive German-speaking jobs in Greece. Key Responsibilities Deliver exceptional customer support services to Netflix subscribers in the DACH region. Resolve technical and billing inquiries with precision, efficiency, and a high level of empathy. Navigate complex streaming issues and provide clear, actionable solutions to ensure maximum customer satisfaction. Maintain comprehensive records of interactions within the support database for quality assurance. Collaborate with internal teams to escalate trends and improve overall user experience in the customer support services industry. Exceed performance metrics by providing a premium, personalized service experience for every customer. Ensure all interactions reflect the Netflix brand identity and commitment to excellence. Requirements Native or fluent German (spoken and written) is mandatory for this role. Professional proficiency in English to collaborate within our international office environment. Valid EU passport (mandatory) to work within the European Economic Area. Proven ability to communicate effectively in a fast-paced customer support services environment. Passion for entertainment, technology, and providing high-quality digital solutions. Strong problem-solving skills and a proactive approach to team success. Benefits What We Offer Competitive Monthly Salary. Fully Paid Training. Health Insurance. Fully Paid Relocation Package (flight, transfer, hotel). Free Relocation Concierge — a dedicated Relocation Experts team that handles documentation, accommodation and settling in. Monthly Performance Bonus. 2 Extra Salaries Per Year (13th and 14th salary). And Much More... Life in Greece Embracing the Mediterranean lifestyle is one of the greatest benefits of accepting one of our German Speaking Netflix Customer Experts position in Greece. You will enjoy a climate renowned for its sunshine, a rich tapestry of ancient culture, and some of the most stunning coastal landscapes in Europe, making Greece a top-tier destination for international professionals. Beyond the professional advancement of securing jobs in Greece, you will have the chance to immerse yourself in the world-famous local cuisine and a quality of life that prioritizes balance and well-being. Relocating to Greece allows you to join a thriving expatriate community, ensuring your transition is as rewarding as your new career. How to Apply If you are ready to elevate your career and embark on an unforgettable adventure, we invite you to apply today. Click the Apply Now button to join Mercier Consultancy Group and take the next step toward your future in Greece. We look forward to reviewing your application. Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow",
