    "summaryAr": "About the Team The Enterprise team builds the control-plane capabilities that ClickHouse Cloud’s largest global customers—including financial institutions, enterprise fleets, and AI platforms—rely on to run mission-critical infrastructure at scale. We solve complex state orchestration, automated scheduling, and distributed system consistency problems across multi-region cloud environments. What You Will Do Design sca",
    "descriptionAr": "About the Team The Enterprise team builds the control-plane capabilities that ClickHouse Cloud’s largest global customers—including financial institutions, enterprise fleets, and AI platforms—rely on to run mission-critical infrastructure at scale. We solve complex state orchestration, automated scheduling, and distributed system consistency problems across multi-region cloud environments. What You Will Do Design scalable models to configure, validate, secure, and audit settings across thousands of enterprise organizations and services. Build reliable control-plane orchestration workflows, such as automated scaling schedules, backup/restore mechanisms, and cross-region provisioning. Ensure distributed system consistency across multi-tenant environments, building automated reconciliation and repair paths for partial failures. Own features end-to-end: from backend API design (Node.js/TypeScript) through the Console UI, public APIs, and Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform) support. What We Are Looking For Experience: 6+ years in software engineering, with deep experience in cloud control planes, provisioning layers, or workflow engines. Core Stack: Strong TypeScript and Node.js backend capabilities, with comfort shipping React UI and working with document/relational stores (PostgreSQL, MongoDB). Control-Plane Mechanics: Hands-on experience building systems that manage desired vs. actual state, idempotency, retries, and scheduled jobs. Cloud & Security Fluency: Familiarity with AWS/GCP IAM, cross-account access, encryption/KMS, and enterprise requirements like BYOC (Bring Your Own Cloud) or VPC peering. Ideal Backgrounds: Managed database/data platform control planes (e.g., MongoDB Atlas, Snowflake, Confluent Cloud, Elastic Cloud, CockroachDB) or developer platforms (e.g., Temporal, Vercel, Fly.io , HashiCorp). Perks Flexible work environment - ClickHouse is a globally distributed company and remote-friendly. We currently operate in over 25 countries. Healthcare - Employer contributions towards your healthcare. Equity in the company - Every new eligible team member who joins our company receives equity. Time off - Flexible time off in the US, generous entitlement in other countries. A USD$500 Home office setup if you’re a remote employee. Global Gatherings – We believe in the power of in-person connection and offer opportunities to engage with colleagues at company-wide offsites. Culture - We All Shape It As part of a rapidly scaling start-up, you will be instrumental in shaping our culture. Are you interested in finding out more about our culture? Learn more about our values here . Check out our blog posts or follow us on LinkedIn to find out more about what’s happening at ClickHouse. Equal Opportunity & Privacy ClickHouse provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type based on factors such as race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Please see here for our Privacy Statement.",
